     {"question": "Which email providers work with Nodemailer?", "answer": "Any provider with SMTP support: SendGrid, Mailgun, Amazon SES, Postmark, your own mail server, or Mailpit for local development. The SMTP credentials differ per provider."},
     {"question": "Does Resend work in Cloudflare Workers?", "answer": "Yes. Resend uses HTTP API calls instead of SMTP, making it compatible with edge runtimes like Cloudflare Workers, Vercel Edge Functions, and Deno Deploy."},
     {"question": "How do I test emails without sending real emails?", "answer": "Use Mailpit for local development. It captures all emails at localhost:8025. See the Local Development guide for setup."},
